{"schema":"contra-studio/contradb-interpretation","version":1,"sourceSnapshotId":"contradb:83:3a9fb6ffcad4476d","snapshot":{"schema":"contra-studio/contradb-snapshot","version":1,"sourceUrl":"https://contradb.com/dances/83","retrievedAt":"2026-10-20T06:03:19.065Z","html":"<h1 class=\"dance-show-title\">Mad Robin in Love</h1>\n<p class=\"dance-show-choreographer\">by: <strong><a href=\"/choreographers/36\">Greg Frock</a></strong></p>\n<p class=\"dance-show-formation\">formation: improper </p>\n<div class=\"dance-show-preamble\"><div class='contra-markdown-block'></div></div>\n<table class=\"table table-bordered table-condensed contra-table-nonfluid\">\n         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td>A1</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">neighbors do si do once</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">neighbors swing</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td>A2</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">long lines forward &amp; back</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">mad robin, gentlespoons in front</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td>B1</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>4</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">gentlespoons pass by left shoulders</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>12</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">partners swing</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td>B2</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">circle left 3 places</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>4</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">balance the ring</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>4</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">partners California twirl ⁋</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr></table>\n<div class=\"dance-show-notes\"><div class='contra-markdown-block'><p>Dancers will try to rush the <u>mad robin</u> to include the <u>gentlespoons</u> cross in A2. Remind them there is plenty of time to complete the figure.  Written for Robin Wilson in 2011</p>\n</div></div>\n<p class=\"dance-show-publish\">\n            shared everywhere\n          </p>\n"},"interpretation":{"notesReview":"corroborated-teaching-summary","rows":{"contradb:83:row:8":{"californiaTwirl":{"hands":"right-left","underRole":"robin","direction":"right","amount":0.5}},"contradb:83:row:3":{"madRobin":{"orbitRelation":"neighbor","facingRelation":"partner","frontRole":"lark","direction":"clockwise","amount":1}}}}}
